<title>UK: Moldova prices $75 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Moldova prices $75 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager Merrill Lynch International has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MOLDOVA</p>
<p> AMT	  $75 MLN   COUPON     9.875     MATURITY    13.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.826    PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.826    SPREAD	+340 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/MJ</p>
